msgstr "Babilim tilføjer oversættelser for hvert sprog, der er markeret her."

#: includes/class-babilim-packager.php:110
msgid "Babilim could not confirm a temporary folder outside the website, so the component was not packaged and nothing was uploaded. Define BABILIM_TEMP_DIR in wp-config.php as a writable folder outside the web root (for example a folder next to, not inside, your site's public directory), or ask your host for one."
msgstr "Babilim kunne ikke bekræfte en midlertidig mappe uden for webstedet, så komponenten blev ikke pakket, og intet blev uploadet. Definer BABILIM_TEMP_DIR i wp-config.php som en skrivbar mappe uden for webroden (for eksempel en mappe ved siden af, ikke inde i, dit websteds offentlige mappe), eller bed din webhost om en."

#: includes/class-babilim-site.php:987
msgid "Babilim could not finish checking this site."
msgstr "Babilim kunne ikke færdiggøre kontrollen af dette websted."

